  "tagline": "Switch rings to dodge the debris, then ride the reentry down.",
  "description": "Your satellite circles a dying planet on four to six orbital rings. Debris drifts across the lanes, so you tap a screen half or press left/right to hop inward or outward. Near misses build a score chain, green rings give you a shield, amber crosses patch the hull. Every few levels the outermost orbit burns away, so you must descend before your lane does. You have three hull: an impact costs one, and a retro burn clears every rock around you on a five-second recharge. Reach the surface in 94 seconds for a rank and up to three stars; the endless Survival mode keeps burning orbits and adding hunters and decay pulses until the hull fails.",
